@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### Health check (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Check current session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### Login (sets HttpOnly cctv_session cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_PASSWORD"
}

### List configured cameras
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cameras

### Fetch JPEG snapshot for channel 101
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/snapshot/101

### Continuous PTZ move (clamped to [-100, 100])
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ptz/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pan": 40,
  "tilt": 0,
  "zoom": 0
}

### Stop PTZ movement
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ptz/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pan": 0,
  "tilt": 0,
  "zoom": 0
}

### Go to PTZ preset 1 on channel 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ptz/1/preset/1

### Subscribe to live SSE alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/stream
Accept: text/event-stream

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
